      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Research article\n\nEMH] - Vol. 25 No. 10 - 2019\n\nSerotype coverage\n\nBased on a systematic evaluation of global serotype cov-\nerage, we assumed that 70% of pneumococcal acute oti-\ntis media, pneumonia, meningitis, and non-pneumonia,\nnon-meningitis infection were covered by the vaccine in\nthe Islamic Republic of Iran (25,26).\n\nCost estimation\nVaccination programme costs\n\nWe used WHO guidelines to calculate the costs of intro-\n\nducing PCV-13 into the current national immunization\nprogramme (27). The price of each dose (US$ 20) was ob-\ntained from the local representative of the vaccine manu-\nfactu",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes the assumption that 70% of pneumococcal disease is covered by vaccine serotypes and how programme costs were estimated, using a vaccine price of US$ 20 per dose plus system costs. A table gives the estimated burden inputs, including incidence, case fatality, sequelae, disability weights and age distribution, with high and low scenarios.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-11"
