      "content": "Research article\n\nEMH] - Vol. 25 No. 10 - 2019\n\nTable 6 Estimated health burden of pneumococcal diseases with and without PCV-13, and discounted health benefitsa of PCV-13\nfor 10 cohorts vaccinated over the period 2014-2023\n\nVariable\n\nCases of pneumococcal disease in children < 5 years (no.)\nTotal cases\n\nAll-cause acute otitis media\n\nPneumococcal pneumonia\n\nPneumococcal meningitis\n\nPneumococcal NPNM\nOutpatient visits for pneumococcal disease in children <5 years (no.)\nTotal visits\n\nAll-cause acute otitis media\n\nPneumococcal pneumonia\n\nPneumococcal meningitis\n\nPneumococcal NPNM\nHospital admissi",
      "truncated": true,
