      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Gives a table of pneumococcal cases, visits, admissions, deaths and DALYs with and without PCV-13 for ten cohorts. It describes the sensitivity analysis of 19 scenarios, including the most and least favourable, and begins comparing results with WHO cost-effectiveness benchmarks.",
